01:21:27.000 --> 01:21:54.000
He got nothing out of this. And you're welcome to go home, Sherry. But right now is your opportunity to help the truth. And... Keith... Are you saying that it was two females that picked you up? What's that? Every time I ask that question, it seems like you don't answer it.

