01:21:54.000 --> 01:22:13.000
I can't even... You sounded rude. You drew out two people in a sketch, Sherry. Or it was two people, the ones that took you. It's a yes or no. I don't know. Well, you were pretty clear when I asked you earlier, what did the younger one do? You said the younger one pointed a gun at you.

