107
01:26:23.000 --> 01:26:55.000
from real criminal investigative matters, but in a time where there are serious human trafficking cases with legitimate victims, Sherry Papini used this tragic societal phenomenon to gain notoriety and financial gain. James Reyes was never charged for his involvement in the so-called abduction. If found guilty, Sherry Papini faced a possible 25 years in prison.

108
01:26:55.000 --> 01:27:23.000
